+			" | passes {:.1f} incl. BLAS {:.1f} ({} dirty clusters) | textures shared {} in {:.1f} ms | submit {:.1f}",
+			totalMs, a_renderer->GetFrameIndex(), waitMs, stats.updateMs, stats.traversalMs, stats.parallelMs,
